{"overview":"Nerdy Walter Paisley, a maladroit busboy at a beatnik café who doesn't fit in with the cool scene around him, attempts to woo his beautiful co-worker, Carla, by making a bust of her. When his klutziness results in the death of his landlady's cat, he panics and hides its body under a layer of plaster. But when Carla and her friends enthuse over the resulting artwork, Walter decides to create some bigger and more elaborate pieces using the same artistic process.","tagline":"You'll be sick, sick, sick — from LAUGHING!","cast":[{"n":"Dick Miller","c":"Walter Paisley","p":"/zyQXh8BkLg0DDo23pxJN2dy6Bqj.jpg","q":"Q1209753"},{"n":"Barboura Morris","c":"Carla","p":"/2tJcGyz8T6k0dzK5BwyhoWYIROY.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Antony Carbone","c":"Leonard de Santis","p":"/6AQ8FrC8A6RPoctlisDidekPv2x.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Julian Burton","c":"Maxwell H. Brock","p":"/gOBdHEM6Wh3TrmdKrSb9brjeUWo.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Ed Nelson","c":"Art Lacroix","p":"/pEDqGHZ958ciZhr4MVxqJzkwkL4.jpg","q":"Q543693"},{"n":"John Brinkley","c":"Will","p":"/zRZpvflEWuZ0AwtEJrHg4236z0C.jpg","q":null},{"n":"John Herman Shaner","c":"Oscar","p":null,"q":null},{"n":"Judy Bamber","c":"Alice","p":"/oGFW2LCwhT94BAIxlRHQcGBUm7y.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Myrtle Vail","c":"Mrs. Swickert","p":"/quBw7qPtOh1x3BuAJ54KeeKYlJ7.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Bert Convy","c":"Lou Raby","p":"/sVS63STnV3JAYFQwk866YxQf1NZ.jpg","q":"Q4895019"}],"country":["United States"],"language":["English"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Bucket_of_Blood","qid":"Q2567687","rel":{"AT":{"d":"1962-06-01"},"DE":{"d":"1962-02-16"},"FR":{"d":"1970-09-30"},"GB":{"d":"1959-10-21","c":"15"},"GR":{"d":"2007-10-13"},"PE":{"d":"1960-12-15"},"SE":{"d":"2022-10-28"},"US":{"d":"1959-10-21","c":"NR"}},"backdrops":["/pg78Qh1zH5GcUqqNuqufGhq5pG8.jpg","/4gsTOBGdC7n3VqcDivAGz0JKxun.jpg","/rxeXjETEcitfRxOr0KpdQPtyEsy.jpg","/wD8HgdGTgvXGfhSzdxXnUQ5CD31.jpg","/eLN82uLULB8ui85774AHGtQcGSX.jpg","/6OF2UGreFILNnoVKldhnkQl22En.jpg","/cbG3oqmBsAU2St4aSujsXKFiFPa.jpg","/jYZ